Alexa Room Sync includes adaptations of the Alexa appliance-ID parser and
Alexa Devices session-sharing approach from scyto/ha-alexa-group-sync, inspected
at commit 7922955902d1ac1716add7efaeafeb6c7a626c29. Its lifecycle, floor-group and
cloud-resend designs also informed this implementation.
https://github.com/scyto/ha-alexa-group-sync

